 "brief": "The Palestinian Prisoner Support Center director condemned Israeli National Security Minister Itamar Ben Gvir's intrusion into cells holding Palestinian female prisoners, Shehab Wire reported. The director characterized the raid, conducted with camera crews present, as brazen theatrics and organized state terrorism against detainees.\n\nBen Gvir, described as an extremist, entered the women's detention block accompanied by media personnel. The Center's director said the incursion represented a deliberate display of intimidation targeting imprisoned Palestinian women, framing the visit as part of a broader pattern of state-sponsored harassment of detainees held in Israeli custody.",
